WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.020
Rewind to the young Earth.

2
00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.650
There is no free oxygen in the air.

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.340
With no ozone layer, intense
ultraviolet light reaches the surface.

4
00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.670
Volcanoes erupt.

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.070
Lightning strikes.

6
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.530
And there is not a single
living cell anywhere.

7
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:20.050
So what had to come together before
the very first cell could exist?

8
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.090
In this mission, you'll see what conditions
on the young Earth meant for the first

9
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.140
cells.

10
00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:30.020
Then you'll see what every cell alive
today may still share with those very first

11
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.120
cells.

12
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:36.110
Your mission: find out what had to come
together before the very first cell could

13
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:36.910
exist.
